#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:53
#: 374a5c8e44f742b2bc9199059636eea1
msgid ""
"There have been many versions of this board and many clones. Best results, "
"with no feature/performance impacts will be obtained boards which have "
"solder jumpers for selecting \"SBUS\" or \"PPM\" RX input. This should be "
"soldered to the \"PPM\" selection for ALL receiver types. ArduPilot will "
"automatically detect and accept any supported format (SBUS/PPM/DSM/etc.) on "
"the RX input with this jumper selection. In addition, be sure the board has "
"a barometer, SD Card slot, and Current sense circuit."
msgstr ""
"此板有多个版本和多种仿制品。最佳效果（无功能/性能影响）将由具有「SBUS」或「PPM」RC "
"输入选择焊接跳线的板获得。对于所有接收机类型，应焊接到「PPM」选项。ArduPilot "
"将在此跳线选择下自动检测并接受任何支持的格式（SBUS/PPM/DSM 等）作为 RX 输入。此外，请确保该板具有气压计、SD 卡槽和电流检测电路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:56
#: fff2d9df18224f0dbd40a4d4ab9cc03c
msgid "Board Connections"
msgstr "板子连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:57
#: 6ab485c054cf4dfe8a8b92648b2001cd
msgid "GPS is attached to UART6 (SERIAL3)"
msgstr "GPS 连接到 UART6（SERIAL3）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:59
#: aa1c9873efd344e3b9cbdbda49fe6125
msgid "Telem is available at UART 1 (SERIAL1)"
msgstr "数传可用于 UART 1（SERIAL1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:61
#: 09680727947048d7b7de22c469550f66
msgid ""
"The shared USART3/I2C pins are ,by default, enabled only for I2C operation "
"to allow external compass or digital airspeed sensor attachment.If at least "
"one device attached externally, does not have pull-up resistors, then 2K ohm"
" pull-up resistors will need to be added externally."
msgstr ""
"共用的 USART3/I2C 引脚默认仅启用 I2C 操作，以允许连接外置罗盘或数字空速传感器。如果外接的至少一个设备没有上拉电阻，则需要在外部添加 "
"2K 欧姆上拉电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:63
#: 13ca1f449b034f0ca8988a78fe4a8b93
msgid ""
"However, by setting :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to 1, the external"
" I2C connection is disabled, so that USART3 may be used as a normal UART. It"
" is SERIAL2 in the parameters listings."
msgstr ""
"但是，通过将 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 1，外部 I2C 连接将被禁用，USART3 "
"可用作普通 UART。在参数列表中，它是 SERIAL2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:65
#: 1039897488324695b619ea775450e051
msgid ""
"The board's RSSI pad can be used as an analog RSSI input. Use pin \"0\" as "
"the RSSI input pin in Mission Planner. Mission planner default values for "
"battery voltage and current scales are provided, however since many "
"variations of this board are available, these may needed to be manually "
"calibrated."
msgstr ""
"板子的 RSSI 焊盘可用作模拟 RSSI 输入。在 Mission Planner 中使用引脚「0」作为 RSSI 输入引脚。Mission "
"Planner 为电池电压和电流比例提供了默认值，但由于该板有多种变体，这些值可能需要手动校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:67
#: 2b94cbdcf8af45b7973ee3d6cc10b9e1
msgid ""
"The RSSI pad can be re-purposed to be the TX output of UART4 instead of "
"analog RSSI input, if the :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` param is set"
" to 2 or 3. And if :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` param is set to 3, "
"then PWM output pin 5 becomes instead, the RX pin of UART4 to provide a full"
" addition UART. Also, if :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` param is set "
"to 4, then both UART3 and UART4 are active and available."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 参数设置为 2 或 3，RSSI 焊盘可重新用作 UART4 的 TX"
" 输出，而不是模拟 RSSI 输入。如果 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 参数设置为 3，则 PWM "
"输出引脚 5 将变为 UART4 的 RX 引脚，提供一个完整的额外 UART。此外，如果 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 参数设置为 4，则 UART3 和 UART4 均可激活使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:69
#: 0dcbc2e287054fa4954624819b1548ba
msgid ""
"If you want to power the servos from the ESC BEC via the board's center rail"
" for the servo outputs, then you should remove the diode as per here: "
"https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2874687, otherwise, "
"independently power the servos directly from the ESC or independent BEC with"
" no connection to the board's servo output center rail. The VCC pin next to "
"the RX in pin is a 5V output only and not affected by this modification."
msgstr ""
"如果您希望通过板子舵机输出的中央导轨从 ESC BEC "
"为舵机供电，则应按照此处说明移除二极管：https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?2874687，否则，请直接从"
" ESC 或独立 BEC 为舵机供电，与板子舵机输出中央导轨无连接。RX 输入引脚旁的 VCC 引脚仅为 5V 输出，不受此修改影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:75
#: 7a6bea589ba4485b9f5b6b4f994286e3
msgid ""
"Video power provided on the video input and output center rail, is provide "
"through an on-board noise filter. Either ~4.5V (labeled 5V) or VBAT-0.5V "
"(VBAT) can be selected by solder pads on the back of the board."
msgstr ""
"视频输入和输出中央导轨上提供的视频电源通过板载噪声滤波器提供。可通过板背面的焊接焊盘选择约 4.5V（标记为 5V）或 VBAT-0.5V（VBAT）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:77
#: 4a801304191148629685919e9e748f13
msgid ""
"PPM solder pad/resistor should be soldered and “S-BUS” resistor/solder pad "
"removed Otherwise, UART1 or UART6 or RCIN will not work."
msgstr "PPM 焊盘/电阻应已焊接，「S-BUS」电阻/焊盘应已移除，否则 UART1、UART6 或 RCIN 将无法工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:85
#: 2866fdf13ef545d0bcafdcf40f7c5716
msgid "PWM Outputs"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:87
#: dbd0104d9bb64c768bd5deb78c5a22fc
msgid ""
"The Pro version has 6 PWM outputs available on thru-hole pads, and two "
"additional (PWM7 & PWM8) on the rear, via solder pads above the \"MOTO\" "
"silk screen printing. The AIO version only provides 6 PWM outputs via thru-"
"hole pads."
msgstr ""
"Pro 版本通过通孔焊盘提供 6 路 PWM 输出，后部的「MOTO」丝印上方还有两个额外路（PWM7 和 PWM8），通过焊盘提供。AIO "
"版本仅通过通孔焊盘提供 6 路 PWM 输出。"

