#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:107
#: 25e7d4ff5f404174a835e231d1892750
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 能力"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:109
#: 72761c73668e4746a4466b0df35e0900
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1/2/6, 3/4/5, 7/8(Pro only)."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但是，对于输出，DShot 和普通 PWM 操作的混用受到组别限制，即在一个组中的某个输出启用 "
"DShot，要求该组中的所有输出均配置并用作 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须相同（PWM 速率或 "
"DShot，当配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1/2/6、3/4/5、7/8（仅 Pro 版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:112
#: 8b7c72751a30458da04a26d74e3bda36
msgid "Flashing Firmware"
msgstr "刷写固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:113
#: f41e8ac28fd1408bbc0314c29bd239ba
msgid ""
"Usually these boards are sold pre-flashed with betaflight / INav firwares "
"and require both firmware and bootloader to be updated if you want to use "
"ArduPilot, as an ArduPilot-compatible bootloader is required for subsequent "
"ArduPilot firmware-upgrade handling."
msgstr ""
"这些板通常出厂时预装了 betaflight / INav 固件，如果您想使用 ArduPilot，需要同时更新固件和引导程序，因为后续 "
"ArduPilot 固件升级处理需要与 ArduPilot 兼容的引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:115
#: 2ea0658578264e82920cfc7552a60c24
msgid ""
"Firmware files can be found `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__. Use "
"omnibusf4pro firmware for the OmnibusF4Pro boards and omnibusf4 firmware for"
" the AIO versions. The pro version will be used in the following examples. "
"Besides the .apj files for firmware flashing via MissionPlanner, there's "
"also .hex files for use with various utilities like dfu-util or betaflight /"
" iNav GUIs. You will also find a _bl.hex that contains the firmware plus the"
" ArduPilot compatible bootloader in case it is not already present on your "
"board."
msgstr ""
"固件文件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/>`__ 找到。OmnibusF4Pro 板使用 "
"omnibusf4pro 固件，AIO 版本使用 omnibusf4 固件。以下示例将使用 Pro 版本。除了通过 MissionPlanner "
"刷写固件用的 .apj 文件外，还有用于 dfu-util 或 betaflight/iNav GUI 等各种工具的 .hex "
"文件。您还会发现一个包含固件和 ArduPilot 兼容引导程序的 _bl.hex 文件，以防您的板上尚未安装引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:119
#: 099d705a52df4165b0d85b344f42c2a0
msgid ""
"The provided _bl.hex file can be flashed using BF or iNav GUI, likely the "
"most convenient way to get ArduPilot on your board the first time."
msgstr "提供的 _bl.hex 文件可以使用 BF 或 iNav GUI 刷写，这可能是第一次将 ArduPilot 安装到您的板上最方便的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:121
#: d88dd5e69f364ae9893604e344c9f1d5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the bootloader can be flashed separately. This requires the "
"board to be put into DFU mode. Tools like dfu-util can be used to flash the "
"bootlader. Once the bootlader is present, all subsequent firmware updates "
"can be done using MissionPlanner's firmware functions."
msgstr ""
"或者，也可以单独刷写引导程序。这需要将板子置于 DFU 模式。可以使用 dfu-util "
"等工具刷写引导程序。一旦引导程序存在，后续所有固件更新都可以使用 MissionPlanner 的固件功能完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:124
#: f2448fd6ec6744cda3781af89005cab6
msgid "Enter DFU Mode"
msgstr "进入 DFU 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:125
#: 28f6ff7766ed48b29214b7f28b737fab
msgid ""
"To do this, you'll need to locate the DFU jumper on your board. On most "
"board flavours this is a little push button thas needs to be pressed while "
"connecting your board to your PC via USB:"
msgstr "为此，您需要找到板上的 DFU 跳线。在大多数板子版本上，这是一个小按钮，需要在通过 USB 将板子连接到 PC 时按住："

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:132
#: 4c9c820590fa4ddfa9881fd01fd0cfa9
msgid "Install dfu-util"
msgstr "安装 dfu-util"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:133
#: 3cd07f94d82a437fbe3530b6e68925a6
msgid "Linux (Ubuntu)"
msgstr "Linux（Ubuntu）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:139
#: 8f91e60267a54afd82bc545f858a6c56
msgid "OS X"
msgstr "OS X"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:145
#: f77e93efa2014f7f9c6a444f49b44c82
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:147
#: 7db1618918c143e8a4339ad843c4cb2c
msgid ""
"Download the `dfu-util <http://dfu-util.sourceforge.net/releases/dfu-"
"util-0.8-binaries/win32-mingw32/dfu-util-static.exe>`__ to your local "
"system, e.g., under `D:\\dfu-util`."
msgstr ""
"将 `dfu-util <http://dfu-util.sourceforge.net/releases/dfu-"
"util-0.8-binaries/win32-mingw32/dfu-util-static.exe>`__ 下载到本地系统，例如 `D:\\dfu-"
"util`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:149
#: 043994e53a594dcabea25c47cc3315bb
msgid "Rename it to `dfu-util.exe`"
msgstr "将其重命名为 `dfu-util.exe`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:151
#: cbc6a25ac9454df5a020b1df95781d85
msgid ""
"Append the path of the `dfu-util.exe` to the system environment variable "
"`Path`: \"My Computer\" > \"Properties\" > \"Advanced\" > \"Environment "
"Variables\" > \"Path\". Please note that paths in the variable `Path` are "
"separated by semicolon `;`. This will allow dfu-util to be executed globally"
" in command prompt."
msgstr ""
"将 `dfu-util.exe` 的路径附加到系统环境变量 "
"`Path`：「我的电脑」>「属性」>「高级」>「环境变量」>「Path」。请注意，`Path` 变量中的路径以分号 `;` "
"分隔。这将允许在命令提示符中全局执行 dfu-util。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:153
#: 652fc3b187044a2db37d24e89f136566
msgid ""
"Instead of using dfu-util, you could flash bootloader with betaflight. "
"Instructions are detailed here : "
"https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight/wiki/Installing-Betaflight If you "
"board is not recognize as a com port under windows, you have to download and"
" install zadig : http://zadig.akeo.ie/"
msgstr ""
"除了使用 dfu-util，您也可以使用 betaflight "
"刷写引导程序。详细说明请参阅：https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight/wiki/Installing-"
"Betaflight。如果您的板在 Windows 下无法识别为 COM 端口，您需要下载并安装 zadig：http://zadig.akeo.ie/"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:158
#: dab003d36b174ac4812d2b9f446b4855
msgid "Flash Bootloader"
msgstr "刷写引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:160
#: 5ca1923834b341fdbfaa44058e5ac31a
msgid ""
"Bootloader binaries for the current targets can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__."
msgstr ""
"当前目标的引导程序二进制文件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/Bootloaders>`__ "
"找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:162
#: 10225bba1d6049cfaf78aae3133d6fd9
msgid ""
"Download omnibusf4pro_bl.bin for this board type. With your board connected "
"via USB and put into DFU mode, open a terminal and flash the new bootloader "
"with the following command line:"
msgstr ""
"为此板类型下载 omnibusf4pro_bl.bin。将板子通过 USB 连接并置于 DFU 模式后，打开终端，使用以下命令行刷写新引导程序："

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:168
#: 3f46debd4f364ba49f57f32f03c434ae
msgid ""
"Once the flashing is complete, power cycle the board and you should see a "
"solid power LED and a rapidly blinking blue LED."
msgstr "刷写完成后，重新上电，您应该会看到电源 LED 常亮，蓝色 LED 快速闪烁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:171
#: 9eb0cad8e6374a16970bd58ed4220de0
msgid ""
"Alternatively, board-specific bootloaders can be built from source with "
"./waf using the --bootloader option."
msgstr "或者，也可以使用 ./waf 并加上 --bootloader 选项从源码编译特定板的引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:174
#: c919368d2d6a4b8f88470c426b059a39
msgid "Flash ArduPilot"
msgstr "刷写 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:175
#: b987ac7209654fba8388c19d3b4417dd
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner and go to the Initial Setup tab. Verify that the COM "
"port in the top right is the same as in Device Manager."
msgstr "打开 Mission Planner，进入初始设置选项卡。验证右上角的 COM 端口与设备管理器中的一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:180
#: 5198f181d4e94403b1c633a5de60b0f8
msgid ""
"Choose \"Load Custom Firmware\" and browse to the respective .apj file. "
"After the flash is complete, power cycle the device."
msgstr "选择「加载自定义固件」，浏览到相应的 .apj 文件。刷写完成后，重新为设备上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:185
#: cb0cf382f6bf41779d73008ed99e9753
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You're now running ArduPilot on your omnibusF4. You can use"
" this same process to upgrade to newer versions of ArduPilot. Either use "
"MP's firmware update functionality or compile your own desired vehicle "
"firmware from source and upload the .apj file to the board."
msgstr ""
"恭喜！您现在已在 omnibusF4 上运行 ArduPilot。您可以使用相同的流程升级到更新版本的 ArduPilot。可以使用 Mission "
"Planner 的固件更新功能，或从源码编译您所需的飞行器固件并将 .apj 文件上传到板子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:188
#: 4a5db3e3e00c47a3ac83cf61ad9b8d5a
msgid "Compile ArduPilot"
msgstr "编译 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-omnibusf4pro.rst:189
#: 19f45b4db9734f8cac668a8614cf36dd
msgid ""
"To build your own firmware, see the instructions on setting up a build "
"environment and compiling the source code: `Building the Code "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-the-code.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"要编译自己的固件，请参阅搭建编译环境和编译源码的说明：`构建代码 <https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/building-"
"the-code.html>`__"

